        {
          "text": "Wayesehamba uMose, wabuyela kuJetiro umukhwe wakhe, wathi kuye: “Ngivumele ngibuyele kubafowethu abaseGibhithe, ngibone ukuthi basaphila yini. UJetro wathi kuMose: “Hamba ngokuthula.”",
