        },
        {
          "text": "UJehova wathi kuMose: “Uma ubuyela eGibithe, qiniseka ukuthi uyazenza phambi kukaFaro zonke lezo zibonakaliso engizinikele esandleni sakho; kodwa ngizayenza lukhuni inhliziyo yakhe, ukuze angabayekeli abantu bahambe.",
